Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.09,0:00:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜我的名字是九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以一飞冲天为目标，立志成为决斗冠军的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}初中一年级学生。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.80,0:00:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？要把宝贝虎龙给我！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.33,0:00:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那不就是超量怪兽嘛！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.69,0:00:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜不行啊，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.65,0:00:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是从德之助那里拿到卡什么的＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜那家伙做的事绝对有猫腻！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.25,0:00:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜你们怀疑过头了啦＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜但结果还是被骗了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.62,0:00:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是输掉这场决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.51,0:00:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据赌卡规则，No.卡就会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.51,0:00:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被夺走…＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.85,0:00:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜为什么啊，德之助！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我还以为我们是朋友呢！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.23,0:00:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普…被夺走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜啦～哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.36,0:00:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被骗了吧呜啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.66,0:00:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱卡 这张呜啦陷阱C
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.94,0:00:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要在我的场地上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.38,0:00:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗就等于赢了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.74,0:00:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢了的话就按约定希望皇霍普我就收下了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.27,0:00:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 目标是我的 No.卡吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.34,0:01:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乌拉～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.06,0:01:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德…德之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.91,0:01:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜…不知怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身体里涌出力量乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.82,0:01:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底发生了什么…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.84,0:01:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乌拉…呜～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.06,0:01:26.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乌拉～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.26,0:01:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他被 No.卡附身了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.25,0:01:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被 No.卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乌拉 乌拉 乌拉～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.84,0:01:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}39！希望皇霍普的 No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.39,0:01:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.37,0:01:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.75,0:01:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.06,0:01:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身…身体…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:51.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么 怎么回事！？这条光之线是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.17,0:01:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果不赢下这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.81,0:01:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就会 从这个世界上 消失
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.06,0:01:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 这家伙快要消失了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.26,0:02:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是因为我接受了决斗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.74,0:02:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在干什么啊乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.46,0:02:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快点回合结束啊乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.83,0:02:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《总之现在要赢下这场决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.36,0:02:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能打倒 No.怪兽的只有 No.怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.89,0:02:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 我手上有的 No.怪兽是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复仇龙和大地咬。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.11,0:02:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.37,0:02:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是等级４的嘎嘎嘎和等级２的芙露艾露芙。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.16,0:02:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行…… 这两只的话没法超量召唤！》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.19,0:02:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.73,0:02:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你已经做好觉悟了啊乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.06,0:02:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一口气解决掉你乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.13,0:02:35.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！抽卡乌拉！！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.29,0:02:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用希望皇霍普攻击芙露艾露芙乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.66,0:02:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.10,0:02:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.96,0:02:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，生命值就是2500对1900。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.06,0:02:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}逆转乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.01,0:03:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把怪兽以里侧守备表示盖放，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.99,0:03:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.39,0:03:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《得快点召唤 No.卡才行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.83,0:03:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去会被干掉的！》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.27,0:03:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.31,0:03:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.62,0:03:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就能召唤 No.卡了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.85,0:03:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤等级3的莱莱德！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.40,0:03:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}莱～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.12,0:03:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动嘎嘎嘎魔术师的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.82,0:03:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次，直到结束阶段
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的等级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.19,0:03:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以变成1～8之间任意数值。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.39,0:03:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把嘎嘎嘎魔术师变成和莱莱德一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.68,0:03:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级3！好～嘞 上了！！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.28,0:03:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把等级3的嘎嘎嘎魔术师和莱莱德
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.49,0:03:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}莱莱～德！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.87,0:03:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.76,0:03:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.28,0:04:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:05.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.17！ 修正龙！！

Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.48,0:04:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.17？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.12,0:04:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有其他 No.吗乌拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.52,0:04:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就把这个也收下了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.38,0:04:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱发动！ 里雾里！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.26,0:04:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么啊 这雾是！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}里雾的雾乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.49,0:04:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 里雾是 在对方场上有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.00,0:04:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽被特殊召唤的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.71,0:04:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}获得那只怪兽的控制权乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:48.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.61,0:04:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}修正龙竟然！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.14,0:04:57.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘻 嘻 嘻… 来～了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.72,0:05:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人的吧！？连修正龙都！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.25,0:05:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜 呜呜…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.80,0:05:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.10,0:06:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然和我想的一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.56,0:06:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张照片 是假的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.47,0:06:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是把别的照片加工之后贴上去的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.50,0:07:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张也是 这张也是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.13,0:07:03.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都是合成照片吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.37,0:07:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 游马的清白就能证明了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.57,0:07:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 到底是谁干的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.79,0:07:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了 太一君！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.17,0:07:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太一君的话说不定知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞不好太一也 可能是同伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.71,0:07:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 太一君？ 我是 小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.24,0:07:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 啊 什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.60,0:07:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有点事想问你有点事想问你。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.45,0:07:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，我现在很忙。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.81,0:07:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太一君！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次再说吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.18,0:07:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被挂了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.37,0:07:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在声音背后听到了门铃的声音呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.23,0:07:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！喂，星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.77,0:07:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又在一个人自言自语了呱。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.49,0:07:53.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！赶紧认输吧呱！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.03,0:07:55.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后恨那个被骗了的自己吧呱。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.89,0:07:56.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.67,0:07:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么非要骗人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.09,0:07:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才能赢啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.81,0:08:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那还用说吗呱。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.62,0:08:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.85,0:08:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗不赢就没有意义呱。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是这个世界的规矩呱！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.82,0:08:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我最清楚不过了呱。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.03,0:08:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是我刚开始决斗时候的事啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.57,0:08:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎 德仔也开始玩决斗了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.44,0:08:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要不要我们教你？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.49,0:08:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.47,0:08:22.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 要用赌卡规则哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.23,0:08:23.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赌卡规则？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.67,0:08:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是赌卡决斗啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.74,0:08:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢的人可以从输的人那里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.37,0:08:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拿到卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.41,0:08:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会被抢走？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样才会认真对待决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.32,0:08:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进步才快嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.61,0:08:36.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们可是为了德仔好才这么说的哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.47,0:08:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯～
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.49,0:08:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但那全都是骗人的啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.52,0:08:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.87,0:08:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿嘿…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.89,0:08:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那群家伙 每天每天{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.08,0:08:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从我这里 把卡抢走的说。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.62,0:08:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个笨蛋 被人家当冤大头都不知道啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.48,0:08:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏这样 攒到了好卡哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.52,0:08:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候我明白了的说。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.72,0:09:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有的事情 都有内幕的说。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.73,0:09:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}越是满脸亲切凑过来的人越有内幕的说。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.94,0:09:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}内幕～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我决定了的说。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.02,0:09:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此那就把内幕的世界钻研到极致吧的说！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.89,0:09:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.92,0:09:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.11,0:09:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不在啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.14,0:09:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 一定在学校某个地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.35,0:09:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.20,0:09:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.06,0:09:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊，向那群家伙发誓要运用里世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.42,0:09:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来复仇的里。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.94,0:09:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了掌握卡牌调换的技巧{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.14,0:09:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}日夜刻苦练习的里。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.34,0:09:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后被夺走的卡夺回来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.23,0:09:54.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.75,0:09:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被讨厌也无所谓的里。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.94,0:09:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底这世界全是内幕的里。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.30,0:10:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要赢了大家就会摇着尾巴凑过来的里。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.00,0:10:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是人的本性里。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.02,0:10:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}社会这玩意儿就是这么回事里。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.60,0:10:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不赢就是假的里。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.56,0:10:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗也是赢了才是一切里！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西才不是决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.10,0:10:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说什么赢了就是一切{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.63,0:10:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗是灵魂与灵魂的是灵魂与灵魂的碰撞！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.15,0:10:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 就是因为说这种话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.84,0:10:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管过多久都会被当成菜鸟嘲笑啊 浦良。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.24,0:10:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不在 没人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.55,0:10:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边也没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.76,0:10:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没看过的地方就剩…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.72,0:10:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}旧体育馆！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.14,0:10:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定在那里！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.33,0:10:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太一那家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.28,0:10:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管是谁干的 我绝对要让他说出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.07,0:10:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太一同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.57,0:10:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？ 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！ 等一下！ 哎哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.01,0:10:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.98,0:11:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊… 还差…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.40,0:11:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还差一点点就好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.69,0:11:13.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你搞什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.54,0:11:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对 对不起！ 没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.46,0:11:19.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是在摆多米诺骨牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.76,0:11:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 为什么会在这种地方摆什么多米诺骨牌啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.46,0:11:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为他说只要把这些全摆好 德之助
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.98,0:11:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}就会{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}给{\fnYusei Magic}我怪{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}兽{\fnYusei Magic}・超量→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.67,0:11:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以从早上就开始摆了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.29,0:11:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.89,0:11:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.15,0:11:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是德之助干的好事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.93,0:11:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.47,0:11:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.15,0:11:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我手上还剩下的 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.95,0:11:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}就只有特拉・比特了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.03,0:11:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此 就用这张魔法卡……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}解放・解放 只有在自己的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}场{\fnYusei Magic}地上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.87,0:11:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有1只怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.44,0:11:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才能解放那只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.49,0:11:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过这么做{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.64,0:12:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就可以从卡组里 把1只等级3的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.93,0:12:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加入手牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}好！ 解放宝{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}贝{\fnYusei Magic}・特拉{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}贡{\fnYusei Magic}……》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}保护好宝贝虎龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.27,0:12:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要守住它……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.89,0:12:13.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 没事吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.14,0:12:14.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}宝贝虎龙……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.94,0:12:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 宝贝虎龙的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.35,0:12:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打不赢 No.卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.37,0:12:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}宝贝虎龙……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.61,0:12:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…… 我要把 宝贝虎龙改成守备表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！ 虎 虎 虎～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.20,0:12:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再 盖放1张卡回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.57,0:12:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为这样就能巩固防守了乌拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.43,0:12:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼…… 白费力气乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.13,0:12:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！ 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.11,0:12:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马那家伙 跑哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.31,0:12:54.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去购物中心那边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.85,0:12:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找找看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.93,0:12:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.19,0:13:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动复活之龙的怪兽效果乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次 把1个叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.60,0:13:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.42,0:13:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升500点乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.48,0:13:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 反转召唤乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.84,0:13:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反转召唤！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.76,0:13:16.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把里侧守备表示怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.53,0:13:20.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由玩家自身 变为表侧攻击表示就是这么回事乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.74,0:13:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 即使没有被攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.72,0:13:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也能使用反转效果乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.62,0:13:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧乌拉！ 乌拉乌坦！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.71,0:13:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乌拉乌坦的反转效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.91,0:13:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把守备表示怪兽变成攻击表示乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.94,0:13:42.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喔～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.63,0:13:44.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唏！ 啊啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.00,0:13:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}宝贝龙变回攻击表示了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.70,0:13:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 用复仇死者龙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.19,0:13:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击宝贝龙乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜斯·流！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:14:00.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！半·不破！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.97,0:14:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}半·不破的效果是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.95,0:14:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上的1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合不会被战斗破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.86,0:14:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 战斗中发生的玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.92,0:14:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害减半。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.45,0:14:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然设下了这种陷阱乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.31,0:14:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 希望皇霍普的攻击力是2500乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.02,0:14:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要能造成一半伤害就足够了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.44,0:14:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咳。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.07,0:14:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 希望皇霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.60,0:14:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑斩。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.46,0:14:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.11,0:14:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.04,0:14:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再从手牌发动魔法卡 乌拉的书。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.59,0:14:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.93,0:14:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 将1只反转效果怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.48,0:14:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成里侧守备表示乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.15,0:14:55.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来又能使用反转效果了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.35,0:14:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样的话，下个我的回合，就算把宝贝虎龙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.25,0:14:59.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}改成守备表示{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也会被乌拉乌坦的反转效果变回攻击表示{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.93,0:15:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后吃下战斗伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.68,0:15:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乒乓。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.63,0:15:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对于游马来说还挺明事理的乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:13.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是你的生命值只剩300了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.37,0:15:18.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下个回合就结束了乌拉。回合结束乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.07,0:15:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.99,0:15:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.77,0:15:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟 铁男。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.30,0:15:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 这到底是怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.48,0:15:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在才来已经太迟了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜负已经等同于分出来了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}2500对300？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.89,0:15:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且为什么希望皇霍普和
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.73,0:15:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活龙在德之助的场地上？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.27,0:15:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧游马，你的回合了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.14,0:15:43.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《生命值只剩300了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.15,0:15:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能加固防守了》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.19,0:15:49.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合。抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.05,0:15:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《针剑士。不行。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.87,0:15:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样守不住》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.59,0:15:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵，看来你想要的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没抽到啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.48,0:16:01.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《就这样没法大干一场就结束了吗》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.51,0:16:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.04,0:16:05.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再怎么想也是白费。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.60,0:16:07.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的场地上有的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.24,0:16:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在超量怪兽里也是最渣的渣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.16,0:16:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阶级1 宝贝虎龙而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.63,0:16:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么都做不了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.99,0:16:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔，难道就没办法了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.19,0:16:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要守住啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.05,0:16:24.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙，为什么把宝贝虎龙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.08,0:16:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。是这么回事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.45,0:16:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，宝贝虎龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.84,0:16:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤针剑士。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.04,0:16:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈～！呼。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.08,0:16:41.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力300？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.74,0:16:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种卡能干什么啊乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.95,0:16:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是能行啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.17,0:16:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要和宝贝虎龙一起的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.15,0:16:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和那张废卡一起？乌拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.68,0:16:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.21,0:16:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}宝贝虎龙，效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.11,0:16:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.08,0:17:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让1只等级1的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.05,0:17:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以进行直接攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.29,0:17:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.48,0:17:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧，针剑士。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.95,0:17:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对德之助直接攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.22,0:17:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}区区300点的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.25,0:17:17.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不痛不痒啊乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.77,0:17:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}白费力气啊乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.80,0:17:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀～。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.50,0:17:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.69,0:17:28.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～ 就是现在。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}针剑士的怪兽效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.40,0:17:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼。 飓风。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.11,0:17:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么啊乌拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.81,0:17:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}针剑士直接攻击成功的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.19,0:17:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你场上表侧表示的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.85,0:17:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}魔法・陷{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部都能回到手牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.06,0:17:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部吗乌拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.19,0:17:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.91,0:17:50.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普和利维兹龙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.69,0:17:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被夺走的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.61,0:17:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从你的场上消失的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.96,0:17:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这两只就会回到我身边来。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.60,0:18:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的 No.卡吗乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.45,0:18:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇… 呜呜…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.71,0:18:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！ No.卡夺回来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.36,0:18:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.39,0:18:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要赢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.31,0:18:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.75,0:18:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复生龙攻击里侧守备表示的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.12,0:18:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都说了这是我的决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.48,0:18:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼… 上吧 复生龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.85,0:18:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击里侧守备表示的怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.72,0:18:55.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.10,0:19:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恶灵激流！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.44,0:19:03.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.66,0:19:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.78,0:19:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得好！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.68,0:19:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来守备怪兽就没了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.05,0:19:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.41,0:19:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！ 霍普剑斩！！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.14,0:19:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.76,0:19:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞～ 搞定了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.29,0:19:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.29,0:19:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.35,0:19:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天您能光临本店
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.53,0:19:45.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是非常感谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.42,0:19:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得好。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.44,0:19:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 No.卡就守住了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.11,0:19:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又不是为了你才这么做的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.81,0:19:54.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.34,0:19:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是场惊人的逆转啊，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.25,0:19:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏了宝贝虎龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.72,0:20:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我输了，乌拉。怎……怎么会，乌拉……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.26,0:20:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.95,0:20:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个还给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.38,0:20:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.66,0:20:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你的卡吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.84,0:20:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为交换别再拿它耍卑鄙的手段了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.04,0:20:18.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}宝贝虎龙在伤心呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.90,0:20:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过你还真强啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.26,0:20:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我强吗，乌拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.62,0:20:23.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.63,0:20:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特别是反转效果怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.65,0:20:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}像你这样能运用自如的家伙我还是第一次见。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.35,0:20:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 哼 我才不会上你的当乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.22,0:20:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我捧上天真正的目的是什么乌拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.92,0:20:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}目的！？ 才没有那种东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.62,0:20:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为真的觉得你很强才这么说的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.14,0:20:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事我才不信乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.85,0:20:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是认真的吗乌拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.55,0:20:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然是认真的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.08,0:20:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游… 游… 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.29,0:20:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.65,0:21:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 被人说强还是第一次乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.53,0:21:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总 总是被人说卑鄙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.67,0:21:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}耍赖什么的… 乌拉～。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.76,0:21:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决定了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.66,0:21:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡你就留着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.46,0:21:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}友情的证明乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.50,0:21:17.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎…真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.16,0:21:19.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.04,0:21:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎嘿嘿嘿嘿…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.90,0:21:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了～！太好了太好了太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.78,0:21:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直想要这个啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.01,0:21:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢了，德之助。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.81,0:21:35.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来我们就是最好的朋友了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.59,0:21:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.19,0:21:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就因为拿到一张卡真是个现实的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.72,0:21:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《把想要的卡还回去。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.25,0:21:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}观察结果其九游马似乎也有另一面…乌拉》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.85,0:21:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼～这是最后一张了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.07,0:22:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.09,0:22:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等，骗人的吧…等一下…。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.13,0:22:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为、为什么啊～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.05,0:22:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗，开始吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.58,0:22:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本周的问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.27,0:22:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用莱莱德
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.41,0:22:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击守备表示的啾骨{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.31,0:22:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能破坏吗？不能吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.02,0:24:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}莱莱德破坏了啾骨。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.23,0:24:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要攻击力超过守备力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.93,0:24:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能破坏哦。

Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.04,0:23:43.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超能力者·罗宾来到了镇上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.90,0:23:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，饰演罗宾的风也正痛苦着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.64,0:23:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下回 游戏王ZEXAL 正义的大放送！超能力者·罗宾登场！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.99,0:23:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧 我！

